[gd_scene load_steps=1 format=3 uid="uid://unitlabeldeftheme"]

; Labels and a PanelContainer that name a type variation the default theme defines (default_theme.cpp:394-401, :814-856,
; :1165-1180). HeaderSmall, HeaderMedium and HeaderLarge step the font size by 4, 8 and 12. GraphNodeTitleLabel and
; TooltipLabel set control_font_color and GraphFrameTitleLabel sets white and size 22. TooltipPanel is a
; PopupPanel variation that gives a PanelContainer a half-transparent black panel. Each variation is the one variable.

